Subject: [PATCH] tests: require A133 LRADC volume rocker

Add driver-shaped red coverage for the release LRADC register bank, SPI 22,
input ABI 2.4, validation errors, reset, and migration. The current inert
stub fails these tests because it has neither the advertised device nor any
conversion/IRQ behavior.

Assisted-by: LLM
